Hello, Steam! Our digital board game is finally available for purchase!

Fated Kingdom - a digital board game for 4 people, which does not put the player in the rigid framework of scripts and algorithms. To survive in a dismal world and save the kingdom of Kinmar, the participants of the game will have to throw dice, take cards from the deck and move the pieces on the board.

https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32623881/81d27965b9aae2f447cd98ceabc8f16ff1725834.jpg

Game Features:

Classic tabletop experience in digital form;
4 player co-op;
Sandbox with no forced rules;
Realistic physics;
Dark and cruel fantasy world.

We are sure that hard work and careful attention to feedback will help us make a worthy game. For us, this is also important because we ourselves want to play it, see it as positive changes, and also be part of a friendly community.

We will be happy to receive feedback of any kind - suggestions, criticism, advice and just feedback.

The game is already available on Steam at a price of 205 rubles. Also, there is a 10% discount until June 4. Have fun!
